00:18:13,033 --> 00:18:13,800
tekan Kabupaten Qingshui

678
00:18:13,833 --> 00:18:14,966
isih butuh wektu kira-kira rong jam.

679
00:18:15,166 --> 00:18:16,433
Kuwi bakal meh patang jam.

680
00:18:16,600 --> 00:18:17,766
Apa waé bisa kadadian.

681
00:18:18,200 --> 00:18:19,233
Ing njaba kemah, luwih saka sewu wong padha nesu

682
00:18:19,266 --> 00:18:20,166
lan prajurit provinsi tanpa pimpinan.

683
00:18:20,200 --> 00:18:21,400
Sawise ana wong sing mimpin lan meksa mlebu,

684
00:18:21,433 --> 00:18:22,200
konflik bakal saya tambah parah.

685
00:18:22,266 --> 00:18:23,400
Akibate bakal ora bisa dibayangake.

686
00:18:24,166 --> 00:18:25,466
Limang puluh pengawal sing digawa Hongying—

687
00:18:25,500 --> 00:18:26,466
apa ana sing tatu?

688
00:18:26,666 --> 00:18:27,300
Ora.

689
00:18:27,333 --> 00:18:28,400
Wong-wong kita kabèh ana ing njero perkemahan.

690
00:18:28,433 --> 00:18:29,233
Ora ana sing tatu.

691
00:18:29,433 --> 00:18:30,600
Kepriyé moral ing Batalyon Elit?

692
00:18:30,800 --> 00:18:31,500
Sedulur-sedulur saka Batalyon Elit

693
00:18:31,533 --> 00:18:32,766
wis entuk manfaat sing akeh banget ing dina-dina kepungkur

694
00:18:32,833 --> 00:18:33,966
lan nggumuni katrampilan Qin Chengxinlang

695
00:18:34,000 --> 00:18:34,766
lan karakter

696
00:18:34,800 --> 00:18:35,733
lan saiki padha siji pikiran

697
00:18:35,866 --> 00:18:37,433
gelem ngetutake Qin Chengxinlang lan mbela kemah kasebut

698
00:18:39,266 --> 00:18:40,933
Ora ana wektu kanggo ngirim pasukan saka Kabupaten Longcheng.

699
00:18:41,033 --> 00:18:42,100
Gawanen rong puluh Anggota Tim Operasi Khusus

700
00:18:42,133 --> 00:18:43,066
sing bali menyang desa bareng karo kita.

701
00:18:43,100 --> 00:18:43,966
Jaran siji kanggo saben wong.

702
00:18:44,000 --> 00:18:44,833
Pindhah saiki.

703
00:18:45,066 --> 00:18:45,633
Lu Heihu

704
00:18:45,666 --> 00:18:47,633
Kowé manggon ing Desa Qinghe karo
Ma Zhenbang lan njaga desa kasebut.

705
00:18:47,666 --> 00:18:48,366
Yen ana sing owah,

706
00:18:48,400 --> 00:18:49,400
tumindak miturut kahanane.

707
00:18:50,000 --> 00:18:50,900
Inggih, Pak.

708
00:19:18,300 --> 00:19:19,666
Kowé saka batalyon endi?

709
00:19:19,900 --> 00:19:21,000
Sapa Komandanmu?

710
00:19:21,700 --> 00:19:23,100
Aku bareng karo prajurit provinsi Qingshui.

711
00:19:23,133 --> 00:19:24,466
Komandan Sun Xin, Batalyon Kapindho.

712
00:19:24,866 --> 00:19:26,233
Lan panjenengan, Pak?

713
00:19:27,700 --> 00:19:29,200
Inspektur prajurit provinsi Prefektur Qin

714
00:19:29,233 --> 00:19:30,533
Inspektur Lin ana ing kéné

715
00:19:31,966 --> 00:19:34,000
Aku, Sun Xin, ngaturake pakurmatan marang Inspektur Lin

716
00:19:34,400 --> 00:19:35,633
Aku ora ngerti yen kowé wis teka, Inspektur.

717
00:19:35,666 --> 00:19:36,566
Nyuwun pangapunten menawi kula dereng ngaturaken salam kanthi leres.

718
00:19:36,900 --> 00:19:38,966
Komandan Sun, ana apa ing kéné?

719
00:19:39,066 --> 00:19:40,066
Yagéné kowé ngepung perkemahan iki nganggo pasukan?

720
00:19:40,866 --> 00:19:42,366
Perwira bawahan iki dudu niyat kanggo
ngepung perkemahan kasebut.

721
00:19:42,700 --> 00:19:43,766
Kasunyatane, Qin Chengxinlang

722
00:19:43,800 --> 00:19:44,833
wis nahan, tanpa alesan, Kabupaten Qingshui

723
00:19:44,866 --> 00:19:46,733
pengawas militer Wang Mao, Lord Wang

724
00:19:46,833 --> 00:19:47,333
Gusti Wang

725
00:19:47,366 --> 00:19:48,933
minangka atasan langsung saka perwira
bawahan iki lan anak buahe

726
00:19:49,066 --> 00:19:49,933
Atasan kita wis ditahan.

727
00:19:50,100 --> 00:19:51,100
Kita kabèh kuwatir.

728
00:19:51,233 --> 00:19:53,200
Dadi kita teka kanggo njaluk Qin Chengxinlang supaya ngeculake dhèwèké.

729
00:19:53,233 --> 00:19:54,366
Demi kebersamaan kita,

730
00:19:54,433 --> 00:19:55,666
lan kanggo nenangake pasukan.

731
00:19:56,133 --> 00:19:57,500
Supervisor Wang ditahan ing njero ruangan.

732
00:19:57,633 --> 00:19:58,566
Iku pancen bener.

733
00:19:58,633 --> 00:19:59,566
Dhèwèké kaiket ing lapangan latihan njero.

734
00:20:00,600 --> 00:20:01,633
Inspektur, kenapa ora mlebu dhisik?

735
00:20:01,866 --> 00:20:03,466
lan njaluk Qin Chengxinlang supaya ngeculake Pengawas Wang.

736
00:20:03,900 --> 00:20:05,100
Anggere Pengawas Wang metu kanthi slamet

737
00:20:05,333 --> 00:20:06,600
Aku bakal langsung mimpin wong-wongku supaya bubar

738
00:20:06,800 --> 00:20:07,666
Kita ora bakal wani nggawé masalah.

739
00:20:07,700 --> 00:20:08,600
Yen pancene péngin nylametake dhèwèké,

740
00:20:08,733 --> 00:20:09,766
wong-wong mau mesthi wis nuntut wiwit biyen.

741
00:20:10,366 --> 00:20:11,133
Ngepung perkemahan tanpa nyerang

742
00:20:11,466 --> 00:20:12,733
mung pagelaran kanggo Wang Mao

743
00:20:13,300 --> 00:20:14,233
Ngenteni Qin Hongying ngalah

744
00:20:14,566 --> 00:20:16,000
utawa supaya ana wong ing ndhuwur sing teka dadi penengah

745
00:20:16,033 --> 00:20:16,666
Amarga kowé wis ngerti

746
00:20:16,700 --> 00:20:17,666
Pengawas Wang ditahan ing njero ruangan

747
00:20:18,033 --> 00:20:19,233
kenapa ora mimpin pasukanmu waé

748
00:20:19,566 --> 00:20:20,433
lan nylametake perwira atasanmu

749
00:20:20,633 --> 00:20:21,533
Nanging, kowé tetep waé ing kéné ngubengi perkemahan

750
00:20:21,833 --> 00:20:22,533
mbuang-mbuang wektu

751
00:20:22,966 --> 00:20:23,833
Kabeh wong ing njero iku kanca kita dhèwèk

752
00:20:24,133 --> 00:20:25,266
Kepriyé kok perwira bawahan iki wani-wanine nganggo
kekuwatan bersenjata kanthi sembrono?

753
00:20:25,333 --> 00:20:26,000
lan nggawa bencana gedhé?

754
00:20:26,700 --> 00:20:28,200
Aku mung ngarep-arep yen Qin Chengxinlang

755
00:20:28,333 --> 00:20:29,666
bisa ngutamakake kabecikan sing luwih gedhé.

756
00:20:30,266 --> 00:20:30,933
Gambaran sing luwih gedhé?

757
00:20:31,400 --> 00:20:32,000
Sun Xin.

758
00:20:32,566 --> 00:20:34,166
Aku inspektur militer regional kanggo
prajurit provinsi Prefektur Qin.

759
00:20:34,533 --> 00:20:35,500
Kuwi ndadekake aku dadi perwira atasanmu.

760
00:20:35,533 --> 00:20:36,566
Aku pesen saiki kanggo kowé:

761
00:20:36,600 --> 00:20:37,800
prentahna wong-wongmu supaya langsung ngeculake senjatane,

762
00:20:37,833 --> 00:20:38,900
lan mundur menyang barak masing-masing.

763
00:20:39,000 --> 00:20:40,000
Apa kowé krungu aku kanthi cetha?

764
00:20:42,633 --> 00:20:44,333
Inspektur Lin, dudu aku mbantah prentah.

765
00:20:44,500 --> 00:20:45,233
Mung kuwi

766
00:20:45,266 --> 00:20:46,933
Atasan langsung kula inggih menika Supervisor Wang

767
00:20:47,000 --> 00:20:48,600
Dheweke saiki kejebak ing kemah, keamanane ora dingerteni

768
00:20:48,633 --> 00:20:49,433
Tanpa prentahe,

769
00:20:49,466 --> 00:20:50,366
Aku ora bisa manut.

770
00:20:50,400 --> 00:20:51,933
Yagéné Inspektur ora mlebu ing perkemahan njero dhisik,

771
00:20:51,966 --> 00:20:52,833
lan nglilani sipir militer metu?

772
00:20:53,033 --> 00:20:54,666
Nèk dhèwèké mènèhi prentah, perwira bawahan iki bakal manut.

773
00:20:55,366 --> 00:20:56,800
Iki pancen kasusahaning tapel wates kidul.

774
00:20:56,833 --> 00:20:57,866
Kaya ngono kuwi rasane para prajurit.

775
00:20:58,200 --> 00:21:00,166
Para jenderal diwatesi dening pejabat
sipil lan pengawas militer

776
00:21:00,200 --> 00:21:02,066
lan kaiket rapet dening aturan lan watesan sing ora ana telasé.

777
00:21:02,100 --> 00:21:04,133
Dheweke malah ora bisa mrentah bawahan sing jenenge dhèwèké.

778
00:21:05,933 --> 00:21:06,800
Gandhewa, muat!

779
00:21:10,633 --> 00:21:11,866
Sun Xin, rungokna.

780
00:21:11,900 --> 00:21:12,966
Aku, Lin Zhao,

781
00:21:13,000 --> 00:21:14,066
inspektur militer regional prajurit
provinsi Prefektur Qin,

782
00:21:14,100 --> 00:21:15,033
aku perwira atasanmu.

783
00:21:15,066 --> 00:21:16,333
Kowé wis nglumpukké wong akèh kanggo ngepung
kémah lan ngojok-ojoki para prajurit

784
00:21:16,366 --> 00:21:16,966
Iki padha karo pemberontakan

785
00:21:17,000 --> 00:21:17,966
Aku bakal ngetung nganti telu

786
00:21:18,100 --> 00:21:19,633
Wong-wongmu kudu ngeculake kabèh senjatane

787
00:21:19,666 --> 00:21:20,500
Tangan ing ndhuwur sirahmu, jongkok ing ngendi kowé ana

788
00:21:20,533 --> 00:21:21,233
Yen ora

789
00:21:21,266 --> 00:21:23,033
kabèh wong isih ngadeg nganggo senjata, kalebu kowé

790
00:21:23,366 --> 00:21:24,433
bakal ditembak langsung

791
00:21:24,466 --> 00:21:26,100
Rungokna, kabèh

792
00:21:26,233 --> 00:21:27,466
Aku bakal ngetung nganti telu.

793
00:21:27,700 --> 00:21:29,033
Sapa waé sing isih ngadeg nganggo senjata

794
00:21:29,200 --> 00:21:29,633
mati.

795
00:21:35,233 --> 00:21:37,266
Mudhun! Mudhun! Kabeh wong mudhun! Lebokna senjatamu!

796
00:21:37,366 --> 00:21:38,600
Buwang, cepet!

797
00:21:40,300 --> 00:21:40,800
Sedulur.

798
00:21:41,033 --> 00:21:41,800
Wong-wong mau wis dilatih kanthi apik.

799
00:21:41,833 --> 00:21:42,733
Dadi disiplin.

800
00:21:43,033 --> 00:21:43,500
Bukakna lawange.

801
00:21:46,533 --> 00:21:48,266
Aja panik, Pengawas Wang.

802
00:21:48,366 --> 00:21:49,533
Inspektur Lin ana ing kéné kanggo nylametake kowé.

803
00:21:50,433 --> 00:21:51,866
Bawahane Inspektur Lin ana ing kéné.

804
00:21:52,000 --> 00:21:52,766
Kula wonten mriki, Pak!

805
00:21:52,800 --> 00:21:54,533
Lady Qin nahan aku tanpa sebab!

806
00:21:54,566 --> 00:21:56,366
Inspektur Lin, kowé kudu mbela aku!

807
00:21:56,700 --> 00:21:58,666
Bro, wong iki pancen wong bodho ya?

808
00:21:58,900 --> 00:21:59,666
Uculna dhèwèké.

809
00:22:01,733 --> 00:22:03,233
Pejabat sing andhap asor iki yaiku Wang
Mao, sipir militer Kabupaten Qingshui.

810
00:22:03,366 --> 00:22:04,366
Aku wis suwé krungu jeneng gedhene Inspektur Lin.

811
00:22:04,566 --> 00:22:05,133
Ketemu karo kowé dina iki

812
00:22:05,233 --> 00:22:06,200
pancen minangka rejeki sing luar biasa.

813
00:22:06,366 --> 00:22:07,333
Aku pancen ngrasa terhormat.

814
00:22:07,433 --> 00:22:08,966
Bro, wong iki penggemar beratmu.

815
00:22:09,000 --> 00:22:10,400
Sipir Wang, critakna kahananmu marang aku.

816
00:22:10,533 --> 00:22:11,500
Ana kahanan.

817
00:22:11,533 --> 00:22:13,333
Aku péngin nuduh Lady Qin saka telung pelanggaran.

818
00:22:13,700 --> 00:22:15,700
Kapisan, nahan pejabat kanthi ora sah—

819
00:22:15,733 --> 00:22:16,633
nuduhake rasa ora seneng marang hukum pengadilan.

820
00:22:16,733 --> 00:22:18,400
Kapindho, dhèwèké ora adil,

821
00:22:18,433 --> 00:22:19,566
ora adil marang bawahane.

822
00:22:19,700 --> 00:22:20,333
Kabeh mau pasukan tambahan provinsi.

823
00:22:20,633 --> 00:22:21,966
Yagéné limang atus wong ing Batalyon Elit

824
00:22:22,000 --> 00:22:22,966
entuk daging lan gandum sing apik saben dina

825
00:22:23,000 --> 00:22:24,066
dene sedulur liyane mung bisa ndeleng?

826
00:22:24,100 --> 00:22:25,600
Katelu, menehi penghargaan pribadi marang para prajurit

827
00:22:25,633 --> 00:22:26,300
kanggo tuku kesetiaane

828
00:22:26,333 --> 00:22:26,866
kanthi niat khianat

829
00:22:27,300 --> 00:22:28,500
Aku wis dhawuh marang dhèwèké supaya nindakake

830
00:22:28,533 --> 00:22:29,966
Persis, kowé dhéwé sing ngomong.

831
00:22:32,166 --> 00:22:34,433
Kabeh telung aturan sing nembe koksebut mau digawe dening aku.

832
00:22:34,533 --> 00:22:36,400
Aku ngongkon dhèwèké nglatih Batalyon Elit kanthi kapisah.

833
00:22:36,800 --> 00:22:38,566
Aku uga njaluk dhèwèké nambahake jatah mangan.

834
00:22:38,766 --> 00:22:39,433
Dheweke mung nahan kowé

835
00:22:39,466 --> 00:22:40,566
amarga kowé mlebu ing perkemahan karo wong-wongmu

836
00:22:40,600 --> 00:22:41,400
lan ngunus pedhangmu, nyebabake masalah

837
00:22:41,566 --> 00:22:43,366
Aku uga bakal nindakake sing padha ing panggonane dhèwèké

838
00:22:43,933 --> 00:22:45,966
Ora mungkin, Inspektur Lin.

839
00:22:46,433 --> 00:22:47,900
Kita kabèh prajuritmu.

840
00:22:48,100 --> 00:22:49,433
Kepriyé carane kowé bisa ngutamakake siji lan sijine?

841
00:22:50,033 --> 00:22:50,800
Ngutamakake siji tinimbang liyane?

842
00:22:52,666 --> 00:22:53,800
Dheweke nglakoni latihan intensitas dhuwur.

843
00:22:53,833 --> 00:22:55,266
Apa kowé ngerti pira akehe sing diobong saben dina?

844
00:22:55,600 --> 00:22:57,000
Baris beban, latihan formasi, latihan tempur...

845
00:22:57,033 --> 00:22:58,300
Mlayu ing gunung, ngangkat panah...

846
00:22:58,333 --> 00:22:59,400
Endi sing ora ngobong energi?

847
00:22:59,433 --> 00:23:01,100
Dadi apa aku ora kudu menehi ganti rugi marang dhèwèké?

848
00:23:01,600 --> 00:23:03,666
Sapa waé sing nindakake latihan sing padha

849
00:23:03,700 --> 00:23:05,366
lan tekan intensitas sing padha
nampa tunjangan sing padha saka aku.

850
00:23:05,700 --> 00:23:07,366
Inspektur Lin, aku duwe siji pitakonan manèh.

851
00:23:07,566 --> 00:23:08,066
Ngomong.

852
00:23:08,233 --> 00:23:09,966
Yagéné kowé duwe bawahan wadon ing sangisoré komandomu?

853
00:23:10,200 --> 00:23:10,633
Ana apa?

854
00:23:11,200 --> 00:23:12,500
Iku koyone ora pantes.

855
00:23:12,633 --> 00:23:13,500
Apa kowé isa ngalahake dhèwèké ing perkelahian?

856
00:23:13,533 --> 00:23:15,633
Aku mung dadi wong lanang sing sopan lan ora nglawan wong wadon.

857
00:23:17,100 --> 00:23:18,500
Wang Mao, aku ngerti

858
00:23:18,533 --> 00:23:19,566
kowé dudu wong ala ing ati

859
00:23:19,733 --> 00:23:21,500
Kowé ora sing nyebabaké adegan iki kanggo kowé dhéwé.

860
00:23:21,533 --> 00:23:23,066
Kowé nindakké kuwi kanggo rebutan panganan

861
00:23:23,200 --> 00:23:24,033
lan sawetara subsidi kanggo prajurit ing ngisor iki.

862
00:23:24,466 --> 00:23:26,066
Aku ora nyalahke kowé kanggo iki dhèwèké.

863
00:23:27,333 --> 00:23:28,400
Nanging caramu salah.

864
00:23:30,066 --> 00:23:31,400
Batalyon Elit nglatih para elit.

865
00:23:31,600 --> 00:23:33,266
Iku ora tau dimaksudake kanggo dilatih
kaya prajurit provinsi biasa.

866
00:23:33,400 --> 00:23:34,500
Dheweke ngadhepi kangelan iki,

867
00:23:34,533 --> 00:23:35,666
dadi mesthi waé dhèwèké pantes entuk sangu iki.

868
00:23:35,900 --> 00:23:36,866
Dene sedulur-sedulur liyane,

869
00:23:36,900 --> 00:23:37,533
Aku uga ora bakal lali karo wong-wong mau.

870
00:23:37,733 --> 00:23:38,700
Nanging babagan perkara-perkara iki,

871
00:23:38,900 --> 00:23:40,133
kowé kuduné wis sowan marang aku.

872
00:23:40,333 --> 00:23:41,766
Kowé ora kuduné ngoyak Qin Hongying.

873
00:23:42,066 --> 00:23:43,266
Lan kowé mesthi ora kuduné nggawa
wong lanang kanggo nyerang perkemahan

874
00:23:43,400 --> 00:23:44,466
lan ngubengi kemah nganggo pedhang sing wis diuncalaké.

875
00:23:44,900 --> 00:23:45,766
Semono waé pungkasaning prakara dina iki.

876
00:23:45,833 --> 00:23:46,766
Mandheg ing kéné.

877
00:23:47,100 --> 00:23:48,166
Yen wani narik barang kaya ngene manèh,

878
00:23:48,400 --> 00:23:49,333
ora bakal semudah ngiket kowé

879
00:23:49,366 --> 00:23:50,366
menyang cagak kayu.

880
00:23:51,333 --> 00:23:53,433
Inggih, inggih, abdi panjenengan ingkang andhap asor mangertos.

881
00:23:53,466 --> 00:23:54,166
Abdi panjenengan ingkang andhap asor punika lepat.

882
00:23:54,666 --> 00:23:55,466
Apik yen kowé ngerti.

883
00:23:55,666 --> 00:23:56,366
Aku wis

884
00:23:56,400 --> 00:23:57,166
ngendhegake wong-wong sing ngubengi perkemahan kanggo kowé.

885
00:23:57,200 --> 00:23:58,400
Mengko, metua lan kandhaa supaya wong-wong mau bali menyang kemahé dhéwé-dhéwé.

886
00:23:58,600 --> 00:23:59,366
Ora ana masalah manèh.

887
00:23:59,400 --> 00:24:00,633
Batalyon Elit bakal latihan kaya biasane.

888
00:24:00,700 --> 00:24:01,666
Yen ana wong sing wani ngganggu perkemahan manèh,

889
00:24:01,700 --> 00:24:02,666
Aku bakal njaluk tanggung jawabmu.

890
00:24:02,700 --> 00:24:03,200
Inggih, Pak.

