01:34:08,866 --> 01:34:09,700
lan nyerang lan mateni para jenderal tapel wates kita

3267
01:34:09,933 --> 01:34:11,133
Tentara kita dipeksa melu perang,

3268
01:34:11,166 --> 01:34:11,933
ing mbela dhiri,

3269
01:34:11,966 --> 01:34:12,966
lan ngusir mungsuh.

3270
01:34:13,166 --> 01:34:15,333
Uga, njaluk prefektur kanggo ngajokake petisi menyang pengadilan,

3271
01:34:15,433 --> 01:34:17,733
lan kanthi resmi ngetokaké dokumen sing ngukum provokasi
lintas wates ing Western Frontier.

3272
01:34:18,033 --> 01:34:20,300
Ing perang iki, kita ora mung kudu menang

3273
01:34:20,800 --> 01:34:22,100
nanging uga netepake kabeneran tujuan kita

3274
01:34:22,366 --> 01:34:24,366
Elinga, iki

3275
01:34:24,400 --> 01:34:26,166
serangan balik pertahanan sing sah

3276
01:34:26,800 --> 01:34:28,666
Ya, ya, kuwi tembunge!

3277
01:34:29,200 --> 01:34:30,066
Serangan balik bela diri.

3278
01:34:30,333 --> 01:34:32,400
Saiki kuwi tembung sing apik. Iku muni pancen bener.

3279
01:34:32,500 --> 01:34:34,466
Kita bisa nglawan perang iki kaya sing wis kita lakoni

3280
01:34:34,700 --> 01:34:36,366
kabèh amarga sampeyan kabèh wis kerja bareng

3281
01:34:36,500 --> 01:34:37,366
lan maju terus karo kabèh sing kok duweni.

3282
01:34:37,466 --> 01:34:39,400
Nalika kita bali, saben kautaman bakal kacathet tanpa gagal.

3283
01:34:39,766 --> 01:34:40,233
Huchen.

3284
01:34:41,233 --> 01:34:42,100
Huchen ana ing kéné.

3285
01:34:42,466 --> 01:34:43,433
Wiwit dina iki,

3286
01:34:43,633 --> 01:34:44,566
Golekana wong sing bisa dipercaya

3287
01:34:44,600 --> 01:34:45,766
njupuk alih gudang dhisik.

3288
01:34:46,066 --> 01:34:48,733
Aturan, buku besar, lan panyimpenan bubuk mesiu—

3289
01:34:48,766 --> 01:34:50,200
Pasrahna kabèh barang marang aku barang siji-siji.

3290
01:34:50,233 --> 01:34:51,533
Ora ana siji kesalahan sing diidini.

3291
01:34:52,000 --> 01:34:52,933
Sawise serah terima rampung,

3292
01:34:53,000 --> 01:34:54,333
kowé bakal ngladèni miturut prentahku.

3293
01:34:55,233 --> 01:34:56,033
Matur nuwun, Inspektur.

3294
01:34:57,033 --> 01:34:57,933
Gudang iku penting banget.

3295
01:34:58,033 --> 01:34:59,300
Wong lanang sing kokgedhekake dhèwèk

3296
01:34:59,366 --> 01:35:00,433
kudu tetep padha ajege.

3297
01:35:00,600 --> 01:35:01,833
Aja nganti gudang dadi kisruh

3298
01:35:01,933 --> 01:35:02,966
wayahe kowé lunga.

3299
01:35:03,066 --> 01:35:05,100
Dingerteni. Tenang waé, Inspektur.

3300
01:35:05,233 --> 01:35:06,166
Huchen bakal mesthekake aturan kasebut

3301
01:35:06,200 --> 01:35:07,166
diajari kanthi cetha

3302
01:35:07,500 --> 01:35:08,366
Ya wis, sedulur

3303
01:35:08,466 --> 01:35:09,533
Kowé wis ndhelikake katrampilanmu.

3304
01:35:09,800 --> 01:35:11,433
Maune kowé isih ana ing gudang nguji
tambang semangka wesi.

3305
01:35:11,466 --> 01:35:12,866
Lan banjur kowé dumadakan nunggang jaran nebas wong.

3306
01:35:13,066 --> 01:35:14,600
Panjenengan memuji kula, Guru Xie.

3307
01:35:14,666 --> 01:35:16,466
Heisan pancen misuwur dina iki.

3308
01:35:16,500 --> 01:35:17,233
Hahaha! Hahaha! Hahaha!

3309
01:35:17,266 --> 01:35:18,833
Kita menang perang iki,

3310
01:35:19,066 --> 01:35:21,000
nanging iku kamenangan sing larang regane.

3311
01:35:26,766 --> 01:35:28,500
Murid Wang Haochuan ngaturaken pakurmatan dhateng guru kula ingkang kinurmatan.

3312
01:35:28,666 --> 01:35:29,566
Aku wis nampa sertifikat ujian provinsi.

3313
01:35:29,800 --> 01:35:31,133
Ya, aku wis nampa.

3314
01:35:31,166 --> 01:35:33,000
Kawula sowan mriki khusus kangge ngaturaken panuwun dhumateng
panjenengan, Guru, kangge bimbingan lan kultivasi panjenengan.

3315
01:35:33,100 --> 01:35:35,300
Ah, lulus ya?

3316
01:35:36,966 --> 01:35:38,366
Maksudku...

3317
01:35:38,600 --> 01:35:39,866
Sawetara ing sekolah prefektur sinau nganti pirang-pirang taun

3318
01:35:39,900 --> 01:35:41,166
lan isih bisa uga ora lulus.

3319
01:35:41,200 --> 01:35:42,733
Nanging kowé, kowé wis nglalekake

3320
01:35:43,633 --> 01:35:45,166
Omonganmu kok ora mutu, dasar bocah gemblung?

3321
01:35:45,300 --> 01:35:46,366
Wenhan nduwé bakat sing luar biasa.

3322
01:35:46,400 --> 01:35:47,166
Dhèwèké pancen sregep banget.

3323
01:35:47,200 --> 01:35:48,633
Kepiye carane wong-wong bodho sing biasa-biasa waé bisa dibandhingake karo dhèwèké?

3324
01:35:48,766 --> 01:35:49,533
Kowé ngalem aku, mentor.

3325
01:35:49,633 --> 01:35:50,800
Aku mung begja.

3326
01:35:52,466 --> 01:35:55,000
Iki kothak musik sing tak janjike marang kowé.

3327
01:35:55,133 --> 01:35:56,566
Aku seneng wis bisa ngrampungake.

3328
01:35:57,266 --> 01:35:58,033
Ah

3329
01:36:01,266 --> 01:36:02,366
Lagu ing kothak iki

3330
01:36:02,533 --> 01:36:03,900
nduwèni melodi sing aneh banget

3331
01:36:04,766 --> 01:36:06,933
Iku koyone metu saka sistem pentatonik.

3332
01:36:07,100 --> 01:36:08,366
Aku durung nate krungu sing kaya ngono.

3333
01:36:08,666 --> 01:36:09,966
Musik apa iki?

3334
01:36:10,033 --> 01:36:12,200
Mentor, iki musik Barat.

3335
01:36:12,233 --> 01:36:13,500
Iku béda karo tangga nada pentatonik Central Plains.

3336
01:36:13,633 --> 01:36:15,000
Iki migunakaké tangga nada dhasar pitung nada.

3337
01:36:15,166 --> 01:36:17,000
Dadi nalika nerangake owah-owahan lan modulasi penting,

3338
01:36:17,066 --> 01:36:17,833
ana luwih akeh kebebasan.

3339
01:36:17,900 --> 01:36:20,133
Bisa ngungkapake macem-macem emosi sing luwih jembar

3340
01:36:20,200 --> 01:36:22,333
lan luwih cocog kanggo ngaturake perasaan
sing kuat lan energik

3341
01:36:22,433 --> 01:36:23,633
Oh, dadi miturut panemumu,

3342
01:36:23,833 --> 01:36:25,233
Tangga nada heptatonik ngluwihi tangga nada pentatonik.

3343
01:36:26,033 --> 01:36:26,866
Kalorone ora unggul.

3344
01:36:27,300 --> 01:36:29,200
Tangga nada pentatonik Central Plains
iku kuna, elegan, lan jero.

3345
01:36:29,233 --> 01:36:30,800
Cocok kanggo ekspresi sing alus lan lembut.

3346
01:36:30,966 --> 01:36:32,700
Tangga nada pitu saka Far West nduwèni luwih akeh giliran.

3347
01:36:32,933 --> 01:36:33,933
Kaya dene puisi lan puisi ci

3348
01:36:34,133 --> 01:36:35,033
padha beda-beda ing wujud

3349
01:36:35,133 --> 01:36:36,700
Kuwi muni cukup masuk akal.

3350
01:36:37,133 --> 01:36:39,200
Kowé nembe waé ngomong nèk tangga nada pitu kuwi luwih

3351
01:36:39,233 --> 01:36:41,366
cocok kanggo ngungkapke emosi sing kuat.

3352
01:36:41,400 --> 01:36:42,633
Apa kowé duwe potongan kaya ngono?

3353
01:36:42,666 --> 01:36:44,133
Aku nindakake. Rungokna iki.

3354
01:36:46,300 --> 01:36:47,500
Hmm, musik kuwi asale saka ngendi?

3355
01:36:47,766 --> 01:36:48,533
Ah!

3356
01:36:50,533 --> 01:36:51,266
Hei, ganteng.

3357
01:36:51,300 --> 01:36:52,566
Kowé mikir aku tenan arep nyanyi?

3358
01:36:52,700 --> 01:36:54,000
Aku ora duwe hak, kepiye carane aku bisa nembangake?

3359
01:36:54,033 --> 01:36:56,300
Haha, ukara sing apik tenan—nglirwakake kerajaan kaya gulungan sing dicet

3360
01:36:56,333 --> 01:36:57,433
mung kanggo nukar karo raine sing mesem kaya kembang

3361
01:36:57,466 --> 01:36:59,033
Ukara sing apik banget babagan ninggalake jagad iki kanggo esemane

3362
01:36:59,800 --> 01:37:01,133
Semangat kepahlawanan lan katresnan sing lembut

3363
01:37:01,166 --> 01:37:02,300
bisa urip bebarengan kanthi sampurna

3364
01:37:02,400 --> 01:37:04,833
Wenhan, kowé ora mung duwé bakat—kowé uga bocah ajaib.

3365
01:37:05,200 --> 01:37:07,066
Wenhan, kowé lulus ujian provinsi.

3366
01:37:07,100 --> 01:37:08,400
Apa rencanamu saiki?

3367
01:37:08,800 --> 01:37:09,566
Mentor.

3368
01:37:09,833 --> 01:37:11,533
Aku arep pamitan karo kowé dina iki, mentor,

3369
01:37:11,566 --> 01:37:13,066
lan langsung budhal menyang Ibukota.

3370
01:37:13,200 --> 01:37:14,466
Oh, cepet banget ya?

3371
01:37:14,633 --> 01:37:16,166
Ujian metropolitan bakal dianakake ing musim semi taun ngarep.

3372
01:37:16,200 --> 01:37:17,266
Saiki mung Agustus.

3373
01:37:17,433 --> 01:37:18,200
Dalane dawa

3374
01:37:18,233 --> 01:37:19,400
nanging ora perlu kesusu

3375
01:37:19,433 --> 01:37:20,600
Aku péngin tekan Ibukota luwih awal

3376
01:37:20,900 --> 01:37:22,166
Kapisan, supaya kenal karo ibukutha.

3377
01:37:22,200 --> 01:37:23,800
Kapindho, ngunjungi sawetara sarjana senior.

3378
01:37:23,833 --> 01:37:24,633
Persiapan sing luwih akeh.

3379
01:37:25,200 --> 01:37:27,333
Kejaba iku, ing dalan aku isih kudu ngirim

3380
01:37:27,366 --> 01:37:28,633
layang saka wong tuwa ing kulawargaku,

3381
01:37:28,700 --> 01:37:29,633
dadi aku kuduné budhal luwih awal.

3382
01:37:29,833 --> 01:37:31,433
Ibukotane makmur,

3383
01:37:31,600 --> 01:37:32,500
nanging uga kebak masalah.

3384
01:37:32,633 --> 01:37:34,333
Nalika kowé lunga, ati-ati ing tembung lan tumindak,

3385
01:37:34,366 --> 01:37:35,300
lan fokus karo sinaumu.

3386
01:37:35,333 --> 01:37:36,200
Kanthi bakatmu,

3387
01:37:36,266 --> 01:37:38,133
entuk peringkat ing daftar kehormatan ing ujian kekaisaran
mesthine dudu tantangan babar pisan.

3388
01:37:38,566 --> 01:37:39,833
Aku bakal ngelingi piwulangmu, Guru.

3389
01:37:42,200 --> 01:37:43,433
Jaga, Sister Qingyuan.

3390
01:37:43,633 --> 01:37:44,700
Yen kothak musik iki rusak,

3391
01:37:44,733 --> 01:37:45,900
utawa yen sampeyan péngin ngrungokake lagu anyar liyane,

3392
01:37:46,033 --> 01:37:47,533
Aku bakal nggawekké liyané kanggo kowé nalika aku bali.

3393
01:37:47,833 --> 01:37:48,600
Mm.

3394
01:38:00,366 --> 01:38:01,166
Sugeng tindak, Prefektur Qin.

3395
01:38:01,733 --> 01:38:02,633
Menyang ibukutha aku lunga

3396
01:38:02,666 --> 01:38:03,533
Sewu mil adohé

3397
01:38:03,666 --> 01:38:04,600
Dalan ing ngarep iku dawa

3398
01:38:05,333 --> 01:38:06,400
Kapisan, menyang Prefektur Zhending

3399
01:38:10,166 --> 01:38:10,833
Sedulur lanang,

3400
01:38:11,400 --> 01:38:12,400
Murid iki sing wis kok tampi

3401
01:38:12,633 --> 01:38:13,533
pancen dudu wong biasa.

3402
01:38:13,866 --> 01:38:14,366
Oh. ...

3403
01:38:15,066 --> 01:38:15,766
Apa sing wis ditindakake saiki

3404
01:38:15,900 --> 01:38:17,000
sing bertentangan banget karo klasik lan tumindak sing bener?

3405
01:38:17,266 --> 01:38:17,766
Terusna, critakna marang aku.

3406
01:38:18,066 --> 01:38:18,833
Deloken dhèwèké.

3407
01:38:19,300 --> 01:38:20,400
Yeli Renyong ngalami kekalahan gedhé

3408
01:38:20,733 --> 01:38:21,766
kerugian gedhé ing tangane.

3409
01:38:25,600 --> 01:38:27,700
Yeli Canglang, pamimpin Suku Roulang
ing Tapel Wates Kulon.

3410
01:38:27,933 --> 01:38:28,700
Ngaku-ngaku nggoleki katentreman,

3411
01:38:28,866 --> 01:38:30,566
dhèwèké ngongkon aku ketemu ing Clearwater River Valley.

3412
01:38:30,833 --> 01:38:32,000
Sepisanan, aku curiga karo omongane lan raine sing owah—

3413
01:38:32,166 --> 01:38:32,800
dhèwèké katon ora tulus.

3414
01:38:33,000 --> 01:38:33,966
Dadi aku meneng-meneng ngutus wong-wong kanggo nyelidiki.

3415
01:38:34,266 --> 01:38:35,066
Pancen bener, aku krungu yen Yeli Renyong wis diam-diam

3416
01:38:35,200 --> 01:38:36,666
kanthi diam-diam ndhelik kavaleri elit
ing lembah ing sanjabane tapel wates.

3417
01:38:36,966 --> 01:38:38,566
Dheweke uga mrentahake Yeli Canglang supaya pura-pura nglakoni negosiasi perdamaian.

3418
01:38:38,766 --> 01:38:39,500
nalika diam-diam ndhelikake niat kanggo nyerbu kita.

3419
01:38:39,833 --> 01:38:40,833
Dadi aku nyiapake pasukanku

3420
01:38:41,033 --> 01:38:42,066
lan lunga menyang rapat karo rong atus prajurit berkuda

3421
01:38:42,233 --> 01:38:44,033
Aku uga ngutus Qin Hongying lan liya-liyane
kanggo nyegat ing mburiku.

3422
01:38:44,166 --> 01:38:45,533
Xie Changfeng lan anak buahe ngenggoni
dataran dhuwur lan jalur strategis.

3423
01:38:45,666 --> 01:38:47,233
Lu Heihu lan anak buahe wis ngubur bahan peledak luwih dhisik.

3424
01:38:47,533 --> 01:38:48,333
Aku ngerti dhèwèké bakal ngiyanati kita.

3425
01:38:48,466 --> 01:38:49,300
mula aku nyerang dhisik kanggo njupuk inisiatif,

3426
01:38:49,466 --> 01:38:50,833
lan matèni Yeli Canglang sadurungé garis perang.

3427
01:38:51,066 --> 01:38:51,966
Banjur aku mimpin pasukanku mundur alon-alon,

3428
01:38:52,066 --> 01:38:52,833
ngajak dhèwèké mlebu luwih jero.

3429
01:38:52,933 --> 01:38:55,600
Sawise separo saka kavaleri mungsuh mlebu ing penyergapan,
kita njeblugake ranjau darat.

3430
01:38:55,733 --> 01:38:57,466
Kita nyerang dhèwèké bebarengan nganggo ranjau darat
sing ngguncang bumi lan Qinghe Crossbow.

3431
01:38:57,600 --> 01:38:58,333
Para begal padha kakehan ribut.

3432
01:38:58,466 --> 01:38:59,600
Pasukan kita banjur pecah lan nyerang saka loro-lorone.

3433
01:38:59,733 --> 01:39:00,366
Diserang saka ngarep lan mburi,

3434
01:39:00,500 --> 01:39:01,500
anak buahe cepet-cepet ndhukung dhèwèké lan mundur

3435
01:39:01,600 --> 01:39:02,233
Wong-wong mau mimpin pasukan berkuda mundur.

3436
01:39:02,366 --> 01:39:03,600
Banjur tentara pusat kanthi salah
nyuworo gong tandha mundur.

3437
01:39:03,733 --> 01:39:05,200
Mungsuhe wis ora semangat blas lan kalah telak.

3438
01:39:05,366 --> 01:39:07,000
Ing perang kuwi, 811 prajurit mungsuh tiwas.

3439
01:39:07,166 --> 01:39:08,400
Nangkep 277 prajurit mungsuh sing isih urip

3440
01:39:08,566 --> 01:39:09,633
Nyita 712 jaran perang

3441
01:39:11,166 --> 01:39:13,333
Yeli Renyong nyoba masang jebakan kanggo Lin Zhao,

3442
01:39:13,733 --> 01:39:15,000
nanging Lin Zhao nganggo rencanane dhèwèké kanggo nglawan dhèwèké.

3443
01:39:15,266 --> 01:39:15,733
Huaichuan

3444
01:39:16,066 --> 01:39:16,900
Saka tugu peringatan iki

3445
01:39:17,066 --> 01:39:18,100
Yeli Renyong mbokmenawa

3446
01:39:18,233 --> 01:39:19,266
mati utawa tatu parah

3447
01:39:19,500 --> 01:39:21,100
Yen ora, tentara pusaté ora bakal tau

3448
01:39:21,233 --> 01:39:23,666
mundur nalika loro tentara isih perang

3449
01:39:23,866 --> 01:39:24,933
Kuwi dosa gedhé ing perang.

3450
01:39:25,233 --> 01:39:26,933
Kemungkinan gedhé, dhèwèké wis mati.

3451
01:39:27,100 --> 01:39:27,800
Sanajan dhèwèké isih urip,

3452
01:39:27,966 --> 01:39:29,000
dhèwèké wis kelangan separo nyawané.

3453
01:39:30,266 --> 01:39:32,333
Nanging ana siji bab sing aneh.

3454
01:39:32,633 --> 01:39:33,866
Kepiye carane dhèwèké ngatur

3455
01:39:34,033 --> 01:39:35,266
nglarani Yeli Renyong

3456
01:39:35,633 --> 01:39:37,033
ngliwati kekacauan ing garis ngarep?

3457
01:39:37,400 --> 01:39:39,933
Apa sampeyan ngerti yen dhèwèké nggawé mekanisme panah dhèwèk?

3458
01:39:40,433 --> 01:39:41,533
diarani Qinghe Crossbow?

3459
01:39:42,333 --> 01:39:45,133
Aku ngerti sithik. Aku mung tau krungu jeneng kuwi sadurungé.

3460
01:39:45,766 --> 01:39:48,233
Jarak maksimal panah iki yaiku telung atus langkah.

3461
01:39:48,766 --> 01:39:51,300
Jarak efektif lan mematikané udakara rong atus langkah.

3462
01:39:51,633 --> 01:39:53,800
Kanthi kecepatan 150 langkah, iku bisa nembus waja kulit.

3463
01:39:54,333 --> 01:39:56,300
Sajrone 70 langkah, iku bisa nembus waja wesi.

3464
01:39:57,466 --> 01:39:59,633
Apa? Mikir ana senjata kaya ngono!

3465
01:40:00,000 --> 01:40:00,666
Yen kuwi bener,

3466
01:40:01,000 --> 01:40:02,933
banjur kabèh panah lawas tentara tapel wates wis ora digunakake manèh.

3467
01:40:03,433 --> 01:40:04,500
Nanging yen senjata kaya ngono kuwi ana

3468
01:40:04,733 --> 01:40:05,833
Kok ora diajukake menyang pengadilan

3469
01:40:06,033 --> 01:40:07,033
tinimbang nggawé lan nganggo kanthi rahasia?

3470
01:40:07,333 --> 01:40:09,033
Aku uga takon kuwi marang dhèwèké.

3471
01:40:09,466 --> 01:40:11,133
Dheweke kandha yen kita ngajokake menyang pengadilan,

3472
01:40:11,500 --> 01:40:12,500
Aku wedi karo apa sing kita serahkan dina iki,

3473
01:40:12,733 --> 01:40:13,900
mungsuh bakal nguwasani sesuk.

3474
01:40:14,300 --> 01:40:14,766
